# X API (optional — X discovery feed only)

# App-only Bearer Token from https://developer.x.com
# Developer Console → your Project/App → Keys and tokens → Bearer Token
# Required only for live recent search (`--live`). Never commit this file.
X_BEARER_TOKEN=

# Aliases (first non-empty wins if X_BEARER_TOKEN is unset):
# TWITTER_BEARER_TOKEN=
# X_API_BEARER_TOKEN=

# Offline X feed (checked-in fixture, no network). Also: pass --demo on the CLI.
# X_DEMO=1

# Do not commit this file. Marketplace list/search/compare work without any of the above.
